name "Godot 3 to 4 Migration"

target "godot"
ast-set ""

description r#"Godot 3 to 4 Migration
======================

This example migrates a small Godot 3 project to Godot 4 syntax, using the file
extension to pick the language: exported variables become @export annotations
and KinematicBody2D becomes CharacterBody2D, both in scripts and in scenes"#
